DTSTAMP:20260804T161637Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260103
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260104
SUMMARY:Earth at perihelion
CATEGORIES:PLANET
DESCRIPTION:Sichtbarkeit: No direct visual change\; solar disk slightly larger\n\nEarth is closest to the Sun on 2026-01-03 (about 17:16 UTC)\; seasons are still controlled mainly by axial tilt.
X-PLANETENUHR-VISIBILITY:No direct visual change\; solar disk slightly larger
END:VEVENT
